<!DOCTYPE html>
<!--
  UNIFIED WebArena + VisualWebArena homepage TEMPLATE (rendered at start time).

  This is the source-of-truth for the served `index.html`. start.sh's
  `render_homepage_index` (called just before `start_homepage_flask`'s
  `flask run`) copies this file to `index.html`, substituting each site's
  `__SITE_<NAME>__` host:port placeholder with the host:port parsed from the
  matching WA_*/VWA_* env var (set by `export_webarena_env` /
  `export_classifieds_env`). The trailing PATH on each link is preserved.

  Why a template + render (vs the upstream static index.html): upstream ships
  `<your-server-hostname>:<DEFAULT_PORT>` placeholders and REQUIRES the operator
  to substitute the hostname before serving (VWA environment_docker/README.md
  runs a one-shot perl substitution). cua-lite auto-picks WA ports
  (_auto_pick_webarena_ports, 8500-8999) so the DEFAULT ports (7770/7780/9999/
  8023/8888/3000/9980) are wrong on most runs, and the placeholder host was
  never substituted at all → every homepage link was dead. This template makes
  the substitution port-accurate and scope-aware (it reads the SAME env vars the
  Python client resolves), replacing the upstream perl one-liner.

  Cards merge the reference WebArena index.html (OneStopShop / Merchant Admin /
  Reddit / Gitlab / Map) with the VWA index.html (Classifieds / Wikipedia), so
  every provisioned site is listed. A card whose env var is unset (e.g. Map when
  OSM isn't provisioned, or Classifieds under plain WebArena) is DROPPED by the
  render step so no broken link is emitted.

  Placeholder convention (one per site, must stay on the `<a href>` line):
    __SITE_SHOPPING__         -> host:port of WA_SHOPPING / VWA_SHOPPING
    __SITE_SHOPPING_ADMIN__   -> host:port of WA_SHOPPING_ADMIN
    __SITE_REDDIT__           -> host:port of WA_REDDIT / VWA_REDDIT
    __SITE_GITLAB__           -> host:port of WA_GITLAB
    __SITE_WIKIPEDIA__        -> host:port of WA_WIKIPEDIA / VWA_WIKIPEDIA
    __SITE_MAP__              -> host:port of WA_MAP
    __SITE_CLASSIFIEDS__      -> host:port of VWA_CLASSIFIEDS
-->
<html>
<head>
    <title>Homepage</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: white;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        #container {
            width: 90%;
            margin: auto;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        #header {
            background-color: #f4f7f9;
            color: #232f34;
            padding-top: 30px;
            min-height: 70px;
            border-bottom: #b1c1c6 3px solid;
            font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
        }

        #header h1 {
            padding: 5px;
            margin: 0;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .card {
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 5px;
            width: 200px; /* Changed width */
            height: 200px; /* Added height */
            text-align: center;
            margin: 10px;
            padding: 10px;
            box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            display: inline-block;
            overflow: auto; /* To handle content that might overflow */
        }

        .card img {
            width: 35%;
        }

        .card h2 {
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .card p {
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .card a {
            color: #35424a;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div id="container">
        <br/>
        <div id="header">
            <h1>Welcome to WebArena</h1>
        </div>

        <div class="card" role="region" aria-label="OneStopShop">
         <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='figures/onestopshop.png') }}"  alt="Logo for OneStopShop">
         <a href="http://__SITE_SHOPPING__/">
            <h2 id="appName">OneStopShop</h2>
         </a>
         <p id="appDescription">An online shopping site</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" role="region" aria-label="Merchant Admin Portal">
            <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='figures/cms.png') }}"  alt="Logo for CMS">
            <a href="http://__SITE_SHOPPING_ADMIN__/admin">
                <h2 id="appName">Merchant Admin Portal</h2>
            </a>
            <p id="appDescription">An admin portal to manage E-commerce business (u: admin, p: admin1234)</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" role="region" aria-label="Reddit">
            <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='figures/reddit.png') }}"  alt="Logo for Reddit">
            <a href="http://__SITE_REDDIT__/forums/all">
                <h2 id="appName">Reddit</h2>
            </a>
            <p id="appDescription">A social news aggregation and discussion website</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" role="region" aria-label="Gitlab">
            <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='figures/gitlab.png') }}"  alt="Logo for Gitlab">
            <a href="http://__SITE_GITLAB__/explore">
                <h2 id="appName">Gitlab</h2>
            </a>
            <p id="appDescription">a DevOps software</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" role="region" aria-label="Map">
            <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='figures/map.png') }}"  alt="Logo for Map">
            <a href="http://__SITE_MAP__/">
                <h2 id="appName">OpenStreetMap</h2>
            </a>
            <p id="appDescription">North east US map</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" role="region" aria-label="Wikipedia">
            <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='figures/wikipedia.png') }}"  alt="Logo for Wikipedia">
            <a href="http://__SITE_WIKIPEDIA__/wikipedia_en_all_maxi_2022-05/A/User:The_other_Kiwix_guy/Landing">
                <h2 id="appName">Wikipedia</h2>
            </a>
            <p id="appDescription">An online encyclopedia</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" role="region" aria-label="Classifieds">
            <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='figures/classifieds.png') }}"  alt="Logo for Classifieds">
            <a href="http://__SITE_CLASSIFIEDS__/">
                <h2 id="appName">Classifieds</h2>
            </a>
            <p id="appDescription">A classifieds website for people to sell and buy things</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" role="region" aria-label="Calculator">
            <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='figures/calculator.png') }}"  alt="Logo for Calculator">
            <a href="calculator.html">
                <h2 id="appName">Calculator</h2>
            </a>
            <p id="appDescription">A calculator</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" role="region" aria-label="Scratchpad">
            <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='figures/scratchpad.png') }}"  alt="Logo for Scratchpad">
            <a href="scratchpad.html">
                <h2 id="appName">Scratchpad</h2>
            </a>
            <p id="appDescription">A scratchpad for taking notes</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" role="region" aria-label="Gitlab Manual">
            <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='figures/manual1.png') }}"  alt="Logo for Gitlab Manual">
            <a href="https://docs.gitlab.com/">
                <h2 id="appName">Gitlab Documentation</h2>
            </a>
            <p id="appDescription">Documentation for GitLab</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card" role="region" aria-label="Admin Manual">
            <img src="{{ url_for('static', filename='figures/manual2.png') }}"  alt="Logo for Admin Manual">
            <a href="https://experienceleague.adobe.com/docs/commerce-admin/user-guides/home.html?lang=en">
                <h2 id="appName">Admin Portal Manual</h2>
            </a>
            <p id="appDescription">Manual on using the admin portal</p>
        </div>
        <!-- Repeat the above card structure for each app -->

    </div>
</body>
</html>
